CodeSystem: IDRPrivateCodes
Id: 99IHE
Title: "IDR Private Codes (99IHE)"
Description: "Codes defined locally by the IHE Imaging Diagnostic Report (IDR) Profile, using the DICOM '99IHE' private coding scheme designator. Intended for Trial Implementation; IHE Radiology intends to migrate these codes to DICOM PS3.16 prior to advancing IDR to Final Text."
* ^url = $99IHEIDR
* ^caseSensitive = true
* ^content = #complete

* #IDR01 "Unstructured Observation" "An observation that consists of unstructured narrative."
* #IDR02 "Unstructured Feature" "An observation that consists of unstructured narrative, for which the finding site has been determined and coded."
* #IDR03 "Procedure Radiation Dose Summary Text" "A block of text that summarizes the radiation dose associated with an imaging procedure."